# Eval-set scaffolding (brutal-review phase 1). The unlabeled JSONL,
# rendered markdown, and labels YAML all ship: the eval scripts read
# the JSONL (embeddings live in the per-command enrichments), the
# labels are anchored to the rendered view, and the CI gate (1.5)
# needs all three pinned at HEAD to grade against a stable target
# rather than the live corpus that keeps rotating. Per-run eval
# dumps under eval/results/ are still derivative — not tracked.
eval/results/